      "body": "**项目简介**\nNotion-style illustration generator 是一款AI插画生成网站，特点是生成的插画风格类似Notion简约扁平风格。\n项目地址：https://github.com/yiquan00/AI-illustration-generator\n项目官网：https://illustration.imglab.dev/\n\n**项目特点**\n1. 使用 Replicate 模型， 理论上Replicate上的所有文生图模型都可以直接替换生成；\n2. 集成stripe 支付、积分管理；\n3. 二级分类、标签体系支持；\n\n**生成Demo**\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55d14d75-b65e-48d4-bccf-3dfade500d13)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f10c586e-9ac6-40d3-a7d3-95fcc49619bb)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edcf794f-6bdd-4a58-8467-877f87fa86dc)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3dc0b5b2-450b-4614-8094-e5a7c361d23e)",
